# --- Firebase ---------------------------------------------------------------
# `google-services.json` only carries public identifiers (the API key, the
# project id and the app id) and it has to be in the repository for the
# GitHub Actions build to produce a working APK. The service account keys
# must never be committed.
firebase-service-account.json
*-service-account*.json
*-firebase-adminsdk*.json

